    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PONDER is a fishing pond simulation game, set in a lore-rich fantasy world!</i><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch many kinds of strange fish, beautifully rendered in low-poly fat-pixeled goodness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Fish AI that you can watch school together, hunt, and grow old and die together?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient countrysides, and cast into a wide variety of mysterious ponds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain combos as you hook one fish, only to watch it get eaten by another!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your fish, and upgrade your tackle to catch fish never seen before!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill and jam out to an original soundtrack composed by the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946380/extras/f9eade2edb4649d8cedf32f0bf118d67.avif?t=1746966863\" data-has-big width=800 height=483 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PONDER is a fishing pond simulation game, set in a lore-rich fantasy world!</i><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch many kinds of strange fish, beautifully rendered in low-poly fat-pixeled goodness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Fish AI that you can watch school together, hunt, and grow old and die together?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient countrysides, and cast into a wide variety of mysterious ponds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain combos as you hook one fish, only to watch it get eaten by another!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your fish, and upgrade your tackle to catch fish never seen before!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill and jam out to an original soundtrack composed by the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946380/extras/f9eade2edb4649d8cedf32f0bf118d67.avif?t=1746966863\" data-has-big width=800 height=483 /></span></p></li></ul>",
